<https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/product/mistrategybank> a migdl:DataProduct ; skos:prefLabel "MiStrategyBank" ; migdl:deliveredVia "API" ; migdl:hasJiraRegistration false .
<https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/product/micoachcompass> a migdl:DataProduct ; skos:prefLabel "MiCoachCompass" ; migdl:deliveredVia "manual entry" ; migdl:hasJiraRegistration false . <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/decision/1> a migdl:Decision ; dct:title "How much history does the Gold layer keep?" ; dct:description "Today the lake treats 16 record types as “never changes” and 34 as “just overwrite.” A review of all 81 record types found that every one of them does change, and 74 of 81 could be needed for time travel. MAISA needs to confirm the assumption before the resolution proceeds." ; dct:creator "MAISA" .
<https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/decision/2> a migdl:Decision ; dct:title "Do the app shelves need to answer “what did we know on a given date?”" ; dct:description "Nine app-facing tables were built to keep history but never close out old versions." ; dct:creator "MAISA" .
